{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016SF5ErE7pAh3GtqCnP8erP","type":"tool_result","content":"23:### Customers\n24-`customer_id (PK)`, `legal_name*`, `person_type* (individual|legal_entity)`,\n25-`id_type* (CC|NIT|CE|PASSPORT)`, `id_number*`, `phone*`, `email*`, `contact_name*`,\n26-`notes`, `created_at*`, `updated_at*`, `deleted_at`.\n27-Unique soft key: (`id_type`,`id_number`).\n28-\n29-### Tickets\n30-`ticket_id (PK)`, `created_at*`, `intake_channel* (in_person|whatsapp|phone|file|web_tool|import)`,\n31-`advisor_email*`, `customer_id (FK)*`, `workflow_state* (FK Workflow_States)`,\n32-`labels (csv of controlled labels)`, `priority (normal|high|urgent)`,\n33-`internal_deadline`, `last_activity_at*`, `next_action`, `next_action_owner`,\n34-`waiting_on (internal|customer)` — drives aging split,\n35-`quoted_value`, `approved_value`, `paid_value`,\n36-`payment_method (cash|transfer|card)`, `payment_state (pending|verifying|confirmed)`,\n37-`payment_confirmed_at`, `loss_reason (FK Loss_Reasons)`, `notes`,\n38-`drive_folder_url*`, `original_request_url`, `quotation_pdf_url`, `production_file_url`,\n39-`cutting_plan_url`, `payment_evidence_url`, `delivery_evidence_url`,\n40-`closed_at`, `deleted_at`.\n41-\n42-### Parts\n43-`part_id (PK)`, `ticket_id (FK)*`, `customer_part_number`, `qty* (int>0)`,\n44-`length_mm* (num>0)`, `width_mm* (num>0)`, `material* (catalog)`,\n45-`panel_ref* (catalog or text)`, `thickness_mm* (catalog)`,\n46-`grain_required* (yes|no|na)`,\n47-`edge_top* (bool)`, `edge_bottom* (bool)`, `edge_left* (bool)`, `edge_right* (bool)`,\n48-`tape_type (flexible|rigid|other|none)`, `tape_thickness`,\n49-`notes`, `source* (manual|import|ai_draft|web_tool)`,\n50-`customer_confirmed (bool)`, `advisor_validated (bool)`,\n51-`validation_warnings (json array)`, `created_at*`, `updated_at*`, `deleted_at`.\n52-Unit rule: everything stored in mm; import layer converts and records original unit in `validation_warnings` provenance.\n53-\n54-### Quotations\n55-`quotation_id (PK)`, `ticket_id (FK)*`, `version* (int)`, `status* (draft|sent|approved|rejected|expired|superseded)`,\n56-`sent_at`, `valid_until` (= sent_at + 48h, extendable by management),\n57-`decision (approved|rejected|changes_requested|pending)`, `decision_at`, `decision_evidence_doc (FK Documents)`,\n58-`subtotal`, `vat_rate (default 0.19, from Configuration)`, `vat_amount`,\n59-`withholding_json (configurable, informational)`, `total`,\n60-`price_snapshot_json*` — full copy of every price row + rule inputs used,\n61-`immutable (bool)` — true once paid, `pdf_doc (FK Documents)`, `created_by*`, `created_at*`.\n62-\n63-### Quotation_Lines\n64-`line_id (PK)`, `quotation_id (FK)*`, `line_type* (panel|cut|edge_tape|edge_service|transport|other|adjustment)`,\n65-`description*`, `qty*`, `unit`, `unit_price*`, `line_total*`,\n66-`source_price_id` (FK into price table used), `meta_json`\n67-(e.g. edge metres requested / waste 10% / billable metres stored separately).\n68-\n69-### Payments\n70-`payment_id (PK)`, `ticket_id (FK)*`, `quotation_id (FK)*`, `method* (cash|transfer|card)`,\n71-`amount*`, `currency (COP)`, `registered_by*`, `registered_at*`,\n72-`verified_by`, `verified_at`, `status* (registered|verifying|confirmed|rejected)`,\n73-`evidence_doc (FK Documents)`, `notes`.\n74-Rule: only role `billing` may set `status=confirmed`; server records `verified_by` from session.\n75-\n76-### Panel_Prices / Cut_Prices / Edge_Banding_Prices\n77-Common columns: `price_id (PK)`, `effective_from*`, `updated_by*`, `active* (bool)`, `notes`.\n78-- **Panel_Prices:** `supplier`, `material*`, `panel_ref*`, `panel_length_mm`, `panel_width_mm`, `thickness_mm*`, `price_before_vat*`, `price_with_vat`.\n79-  Seeding convention (per ADR-004 OQ-2, confirmed complete catalog): **closed set of 3 board presets** —\n80-  1530×2440mm, 1830×2440mm, 2120×2440mm (nominal, customer-facing) × 5 materials\n81-  (mdf, pino, aglomerado, melaminico, chapilla) × 6 caliber