{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011RJdfJX2oky8DhkQeGtexa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Permissions Matrix — Panel-Ops\n2\t\n3\t**Version:** 1.0. Enforced server-side per request. Roles from `Users` table:\n4\t`management` (M), `sales` (S), `billing` (B). Production has **no account** — receives\n5\texported technical documents only.\n6\t\n7\t| Capability | M | S | B |\n8\t|---|---|---|---|\n9\t| View dashboard / Kanban / reports | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ (payment views + approved tickets) |\n10\t| Create/edit customers | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n11\t| Create tickets | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n12\t| Edit parts (before payment confirmed) | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n13\t| Edit parts (after payment confirmed) | exception flow only | — | — |\n14\t| Commercial state transitions | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n15\t| Create/send quotations | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n16\t| Record customer decision | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n17\t| See prices/margins/quoted values | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ (amounts on approved tickets) |\n18\t| Register payment | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n19\t| **Confirm payment** | — | — | **✔ only** |\n20\t| Attach payment evidence | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n21\t| Edit price tables | ✔ | — | — |\n22\t| Extend quotation validity | ✔ | — | — |\n23\t| Authorize exceptional commercial adjustment | ✔ | — | — |\n24\t| Reopen / cancel tickets | ✔ | ✔ (cancel own, reason req.) | — |\n25\t| Reopen closed/lost | ✔ | — | — |\n26\t| Configuration (VAT, waste, thresholds) | ✔ | — | — |\n27\t| User administration | ✔ | — | — |\n28\t| View all documents | ✔ | ✔ | payment + quotation docs |\n29\t| Delete anything physically | — | — | — |\n30\t\n31\t## Data-visibility rules\n32\t\n33\t- Production package (export): technical fields only — order id, parts, material, ref, thickness, dims, grain, edges, tape, cutting plan, notes. **Whitelist enforced in adapters.**\n34\t- B must not edit dimensions or commercial prices (server rejects).\n35\t- Customer tax-ID data visible to B for invoicing.\n36\t\n37\t## Future AI agents (any phase)\n38\t\n39\tProhibited regardless of role wiring: confirm payments, change prices, modify paid\n40\tquotations, resolve ambiguous dimensions silently, delete original requests, close\n41\torders without evidence, release orders to production.\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ba010ed-03ac-469a-a8dc-1e3686220e8a","uuid":"e7efefa4-53c8-4550-9508-35cc1c5b4f93","timestamp":"2026-07-22T13:47:23.561Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/permissions-matrix.md","content":"# Permissions Matrix — Panel-Ops\n\n**Version:** 1.0. Enforced server-side per request. Roles from `Users` table:\n`management` (M), `sales` (S), `billing` (B). Production has **no account** — receives\nexported technical documents only.\n\n| Capability | M | S | B |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| View dashboard / Kanban / reports | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ (payment views + approved tickets) |\n| Create/edit customers | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| Create tickets | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| Edit parts (before payment confirmed) | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| Edit parts (after payment confirmed) | exception flow only | — | — |\n| Commercial state transitions | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| Create/send quotations | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| Record customer decision | ✔ | ✔ | — |\n| See prices/margins/quoted values | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ (amounts on approved tickets) |\n| Register payment | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n| **Confirm payment** | — | — | **✔ only** |\n| Attach payment evidence | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n| Edit price tables | ✔ | — | — |\n| Extend quotation validity | ✔ | — | — |\n| Authorize exceptional commercial adjustment | ✔ | — | — |\n| Reopen / cancel tickets | ✔ | ✔ (cancel own, reason req.) | — |\n| Reopen closed/lost | ✔ | — | — |\n| Configuration (VAT, waste, thresholds) | ✔ | — | — |\n| User administration | ✔ | — | — |\n| View all documents | ✔ | ✔ | payment + quotation docs |\n| Delete anything physically | — | — | — |\n\n## Data-visibility rules\n\n- Production package (export): technical fields only — order id, parts, material, ref, thickness, dims, grain, edges, tape, cutting plan, notes. **Whitelist enforced in adapters.**\n- B must not edit dimensions or commercial prices (server rejects).\n- Customer tax-ID data visible to B for invoicing.\n\n## Future AI agents (any phase)\n\nProhibited regardless of role wiring: confirm payments, change prices, modify paid\nquotations, resolve ambiguous dimensions silently, delete original requests, close\norders without evidence, release orders to production.\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
