      border-radius: 18px;\n        padding: 16px 18px;\n      }\n      .label {\n        display: block;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n        color: var(--muted);\n        margin-bottom: 6px;\n      }\n      .value {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n      }\n      .status {\n        margin-top: 24px;\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 10px;\n        padding: 10px 14px;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.12);\n        color: var(--accent-2);\n        font-weight: 700;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main class=\"shell\">\n      <section class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Panel-Ops Web App</div>\n        <h1>Hola, <?= session.fullName ?></h1>\n        <p>Sesión autenticada por Google. El rol se resuelve desde la pestaña <strong>Users</strong> y la API ya puede leer, insertar y actualizar tablas bajo LockService.</p>\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n          <div class=\"pill\"><span class=\"label\">Email</span><span class=\"value\"><?= session.email ?></span></div>\n          <div class=\"pill\"><span class=\"label\">Rol</span><span class=\"value\"><?= session.role ?></span></div>\n          <div class=\"pill\"><span class=\"label\">API</span><span class=\"value\">/doPost router activo</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"status\">Acceso concedido</div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","numLines":109,"startLine":1,"totalLines":109}}}
